OL,3,GNEWSAFashion brand gets go-ahead for
OL,4,A'flagship' shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK-wide fashion brand has been
OL,7,Fgranted permission to create what it
OL,8,Fsaid was a "flagship" store in Bradford
OL,9,Fafter a similar application was turned
OL,10,Fdown last year.
OL,12,FThe plans will allow Janan, based on
OL,13,FShearbridge Road, to build a two-storey
OL,14,Fextension to its current store, which
OL,15,Fis one of 10 across the UK.
OL,17,FBradford planners heard the aim was to
OL,18,Fimprove the shop's appearance and
OL,19,Fcreate more warehouse space, as well as
OL,20,Fmaking space to sell a wider range of
OL,21,Fclothing.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
