OL,3,GNEWSAFashion brand gets go-ahead for
OL,4,A'flagship' shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsif Khan, Janan Group CEO, said he
OL,7,Fhoped the plans would "translate into
OL,8,Ffurther investment and opportunity" for
OL,9,FBradford and "help strengthen the city
OL,10,Fas a shopping destination".
